- "Follow-Up tab population" = exactly what `USP_ExceptionQueue_FollowUp_Sel`'s own filter logic
  returns, applied with no Lender/Agency/Customer/User restriction (i.e., system-wide).
- Scope is confirmed as **all** such items in the Production `LASTax` database at the time the
  script is run there (per PO confirmation).
- This is a true one-time script, run directly by a developer/DBA against Production — it is not
