## 16. Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Task genuinely open (`isComplete` = 0/NULL) before run | After run: `isComplete=1`, `isFollowUp=0`, `isPendingQC=0`, `CompletedDate`/`TaggedUser`/`UpdatedBy` = this run; task appears on Completed tab; new note + history entry present |
