| 4 | `tbl_ExceptionQueue` and `tbl_ExceptionQueue_Tax_Info` row/column state | Unchanged before vs. after — no new rows, no indicator-column changes |
| 5 | DIR/DMU/TSP active search screens, post-run | Closed tasks no longer appear (those screens already filter out `isComplete = 1`) |
| 6 | Follow-Up tab, post-run | Empty (aside from any genuinely new items created after the cleanup ran) |

